WEBVTT

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.757
To group choices, use the action Open a submenu.

00:00:06.757 --> 00:00:10.853
Key 4, for billing, now opens a menu of its own, which you

00:00:10.853 --> 00:00:12.582
fill in the same way:

00:00:12.582 --> 00:00:14.630
a prompt and its own keys.

00:00:15.088 --> 00:00:19.518
In the submenu, key 1 sends callers to the Billing queue.

00:00:19.518 --> 00:00:24.018
Key 0 uses Go to another menu, to return to the main menu.

00:00:27.565 --> 00:00:30.138
Repeat this menu plays the prompt again.

00:00:30.138 --> 00:00:34.612
Transfer to an approved external number connects the caller to a number on

00:00:34.612 --> 00:00:38.415
the approved destinations list in the Contact Center settings.

